  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>GPL-3.0-or-later</project_license>
  <name>rom-hamster</name>
  <summary>Collect, organize and package retro game ROMs</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.goddog312">
    <name>Zhou Xin</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      rom-hamster keeps a retro game ROM collection in a local SQLite library. It
      detects platforms from file extensions, imports single ROMs and archives,
      groups multi-disc games and verifies DAT entries.
    </p>
    <p>It also exports library metadata for EmulationStation, ES-DE and Pegasus.</p>
    <p>The application does not launch games or download content by itself.</p>
  </description>
